      "name": "DICOTA Approach",
      "settings": {
        "text_subline": "DICOTA Approach",
        "text_heading": "THE CUSTOMIZATION PROCESS – CLEAR AND LOW-RISK",
        "textarea_text": "Many resellers shy away from the customisation business because they are daunted by its complexity: unclear specifications, production errors, delivery delays. DICOTA has clearly structured this process for its partners and made it low-risk.",
